  era: "Section 20 \xB7 East India Company Rule \xB7 1765 \u2013 1858"
  title: Drain of Wealth
  text: Dadabhai Naoroji, in Poverty and Un-British Rule in India, argued that much of India's wealth was drained to Britain through home charges, salaries, pensions and profits, without equal return.
